# Program Capacity Service: request collection for the VS Code REST Client and the JetBrains
# HTTP Client. Uses the development default keys (see README, "Configuration"). Run the
# service with `npm run start:dev`, then send the requests top to bottom.

@host = http://localhost:3000
@adminKey = dev-admin-key-0123456789
@readerKey = dev-reader-key-0123456789
@programId = PRG-100

### Health (no key needed)
GET {{host}}/health

### Create a program with a USD 10,000,000 limit
POST {{host}}/api/v1/programs
x-api-key: {{adminKey}}
content-type: application/json

{
  "programId": "{{programId}}",
  "creditLimit": { "amount": "10000000.00", "currency": "USD" }
}

### Current capacity
GET {{host}}/api/v1/programs/{{programId}}
x-api-key: {{readerKey}}

### List programs, two per page (follow nextCursor with ?cursor=)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/programs?limit=2
x-api-key: {{readerKey}}

### Reserve capacity for a EUR invoice: 201; send again for a 200 idempotent replay
POST {{host}}/api/v1/programs/{{programId}}/reservations
x-api-key: {{adminKey}}
content-type: application/json

{
  "invoiceId": "INV-1",
  "invoiceAmount": { "amount": "250000.00", "currency": "EUR" }
}

### Same invoice, different amount: 409 RESERVATION_CONFLICT
POST {{host}}/api/v1/programs/{{programId}}/reservations
x-api-key: {{adminKey}}
content-type: application/json

{
  "invoiceId": "INV-1",
  "invoiceAmount": { "amount": "250000.01", "currency": "EUR" }
}

### More than is available: 409 INSUFFICIENT_CAPACITY
POST {{host}}/api/v1/programs/{{programId}}/reservations
x-api-key: {{adminKey}}
content-type: application/json

{
  "invoiceId": "INV-2",
  "invoiceAmount": { "amount": "99999999.00", "currency": "USD" }
}

### Too many fraction digits for USD: 400 INVALID_AMOUNT (rejected, never rounded)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/programs/{{programId}}/reservations
x-api-key: {{adminKey}}
content-type: application/json

{
  "invoiceId": "INV-3",
  "invoiceAmount": { "amount": "10.005", "currency": "USD" }
}

### No configured rate for the pair: 422 UNSUPPORTED_CURRENCY_PAIR
POST {{host}}/api/v1/programs/{{programId}}/reservations
x-api-key: {{adminKey}}
content-type: application/json

{
  "invoiceId": "INV-4",
  "invoiceAmount": { "amount": "100.00", "currency": "CHF" }
}

### Active reservations of the program, paginated
GET {{host}}/api/v1/programs/{{programId}}/reservations?status=ACTIVE&limit=50
x-api-key: {{readerKey}}

### One reservation
GET {{host}}/api/v1/programs/{{programId}}/reservations/INV-1
x-api-key: {{readerKey}}

### Invoice repaid: release (idempotent; send twice)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/programs/{{programId}}/reservations/INV-1/release
x-api-key: {{adminKey}}

### Read-only key on a write endpoint: 403 FORBIDDEN
POST {{host}}/api/v1/programs/{{programId}}/reservations/INV-1/release
x-api-key: {{readerKey}}

### No key: 401 UNAUTHORIZED
GET {{host}}/api/v1/programs
